I’m an award-winning marketing and creative director with 10+ years of leadership experience across agencies (ex [BBDO](https://www.bbdo.com/) / [DDB](https://www.ddb.com/)), startups & corporations (ex [Yandex](https://yandex.com/) / [Alrosa](https://www.alrosa.ru/)).

Over the past years, I’ve worked in marketing and advertising, handling projects for 50+ brands, including IKEA, Nike, Adidas, Audi, Uniqlo, McD, Nestlé, Uber and others.

My contributions and projects have 100+ global awards including Cannes Lions, Webby, Effie, Clio, Red Dot and others.

Now I’m cmo @ [staya](https://staya.dog/) and continue advise startups on marketing, work as a creative director on-demand for brands and ad agencies.

I craft marketing & business models, product strategies, help launch new stuff, manage fundraising and produce various types of content.

Member of [IADAS](https://www.iadas.net/), as well as a judge for The Webby Awards.
